  "bodyHash": "O+Fm8UqzN2w=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「踩踏一切」是一個改變玩家與世界互動方式的模組。你知道預設情況下，作物在未蹲下時可能被踩踏。此模組將這個功能擴展到世界中更多方塊，且高度可設定。<br><br>預設情況下，以下方塊會被踩踏：<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>&nbsp; 作物、枯灌木、雙層植物、花朵、（地獄）蘑菇、地獄根、地獄芽、地獄疙瘩、樹苗、海鞘、（西瓜/南瓜）莖和高草。</em></span> <br><br>以下方塊預設不會被踩踏：<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>&nbsp; 雪、竹筍、荷葉、海草、甘蔗和甜莓灌木叢。</em></span></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_enableTrampledBlockItems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，踩踏方塊時會掉落物品，如同玩家徒手破壞一般。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_crouchingPreventsTrampling</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，蹲下/潛行可防止任何方塊被踩踏。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSnow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">雪是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleBambooSaplings</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">竹筍是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleCrops</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">可生長的作物是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleDeadBushes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">枯灌木是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleDoublePlants</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">雙層植物是否應被踩踏，例如高花。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleFlowers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">花朵是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleFungi</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">地獄蘑菇是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleLilyPads</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">荷葉是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">蘑菇是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleNetherRoots</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">地獄根是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleNetherSprouts</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">地獄芽是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleNetherWart</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">地獄疙瘩是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSaplings</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">樹苗是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSeaGrass</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">海草是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSeaPickles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">海鞘是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleStems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">莖是否應被踩踏，例如南瓜和西瓜的莖。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSugarCane</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">甘蔗是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleSweetBerryBushes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">甜莓灌木叢是否應被踩踏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>trampleTallGrass</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">高草是否應被踩踏。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衝刺時踩踏草和花朵：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"544\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">適用於新的地獄更新：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"544\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">也適用於耕地：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蹲下/潛行預設可防止踩踏：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/trample-everything/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔案仍托管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您可以自由地在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤留言，因此留言功能已停用。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請使用&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
